# Combat Domain

Applies to `domains/combat/` and `presentation/combat/`.

## Ownership

- Party composition and per-hero timers (`PartyService` / `PartyService`)
- Combat controller: enemy HP, death/defeat resolution, phase advance (`CombatController`)
- Drop rules: gold variance, item chance (`DropManager`)
- Skill runtime handlers (`habilidades/*`)

## Must NOT

- Import or `get_node` UI (`Label`, `ProgressBar`, inventory menus)
- Mutate `main.ouro` or inventory grids directly
- Write save files — emit `precisa_salvar` / `save_requested`

## Contracts

- Inject equipment/level/tree bonuses via `Callable` on party, not global menu lookups
- Signals: `hero_attacked` / `heroi_atacou`, `gold_earned`, `item_dropped`, `hud_refresh`
- Pause combat with `combate_pausado` during async death/defeat

## Enemy stats

Base curve from `WorldProgress.enemy_stats(world, stage, difficulty)`. Identity and multipliers from `EnemyCatalog` + `data/enemies/*.tres` — do not hardcode HP/gold in `CombatController`.

